 75 years of record on its 6 grids, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids, February to March came in under 90% of normal in 38 of those years, more than any other pair. In 2025 the middle saw April to May at 169% of normal and November to December at 62%. So far in 2026, January to February came in at 39% of normal on the middle of the grids.</p>"}
